                  \&amp;&amp;FX&amp;\stackrel{Fg}{\rightarrow}&amp;FY&amp;&amp;\downarrow Gg\\
                  \&amp;&amp;\alpha_X\downarrow&amp;\stackrel{\alpha_g}{\Rightarrow}&amp;\downarrow\alpha_Y&amp;&amp;GX\\
                  \&amp;&amp;GX&amp;\stackrel{Gg}{\leftarrow}&amp;GY
